{"unit_id":"jamen-jiang__dsh-qoder-worktree#card-zh","repo":"jamen-jiang/dsh-qoder-worktree","commit":"00f444c439ea072df0197ec354dadef9d7a4c16c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-qoder-worktree**（DSH 网页插件）：在会话界面显示本地模式、Worktree 模式和 Git 分支。它把模式切换与分支选择放在新会话顶栏和对话输入行，并在发送首条消息时为所选分支创建独立 Git worktree，再将当前会话切换到该目录。主要功能包括查看并搜索本地分支、创建新分支、把未提交改动带入任务空间，以及在本地目录与任务空间间切换。适合希望为不同任务隔离工作目录的 DSH 开发者。需要本机 Git；Windows 上切入目录还需 PowerShell；不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/plugin.tsx:218-360","src/client/plugin.tsx:800-840","src/host/index.js:149-245","src/host/index.js:470-570"]}
{"unit_id":"jamen-jiang__dsh-qoder-worktree#card-en","repo":"jamen-jiang/dsh-qoder-worktree","commit":"00f444c439ea072df0197ec354dadef9d7a4c16c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-qoder-worktree adds mode and branch controls to DSH sessions. On send, it creates a Git worktree for the selected branch and switches the session there. Search or create branches, carry uncommitted changes, or return to the main checkout. Requires Git and Windows PowerShell; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/plugin.tsx:218-360","src/client/plugin.tsx:800-840","src/host/index.js:149-245","src/host/index.js:470-570"]}
